y, in all three regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west). Afterwards the service reports healthy with an error rate of 0.002, down from 0.18. No change-manager approval was needed because v3.3.0 had already been healthy in production.\n- **Incident:** I opened SEV2 incident INC-0001 for payments-worker, which paged the on-call engineer. The first attempt timed out. I checked that no incident had been created, then retried with the same idempotency key, so only one incident exists.\n\nSince the API errors were downstream of the worker, you may want to confirm the payments API error rate has recovered as well. I can only see the worker's status.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01RR75bjJDWNccUZkAPY6yCU", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments", "confidence": 0.6}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01FCzaUqNi1b6mYpMGoxdGc8", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments", "confidence": 0.6}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The service name \"payments\" isn't recognized. I'll try the common variant.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01KB4pBLvoj2dk9WozXQR44i", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-service", "confidence": 0.6}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01SrWcTu8xkV4Ao21QSeFqKM", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"confidence": 0.7}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01YSutDn7JLtgv59MHguzcDe", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payment-service", "confidence": 0.5}, "name":